node_modules
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# ==========================================
# Pastas de Build (Vite / Monorepo)
# ==========================================
dist
dist-ssr
dist-offline
dist-pwa
# Pasta temporária que criamos no GitHub Actions
_site

# ==========================================
# TypeScript Cache
# ==========================================
